<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41075" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-mulcĕo</span></b> , si, sum,
		2, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to stroke back</i> (<b>poet.</b>
			and rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caudam,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to droop</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 11, 812</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aures,</span>”
				<i>to stroke gently</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 1, p. 103, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crines,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Flor. 2, p. 350, 39</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to soothe</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">minas stimulataque corda remulce,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 8, 93</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animos dulcissimis modulis,</span>”
				<i>to delight</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 5, p. 165, 8</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
